residuals[1]['cause']='plantuml_metrics.rs::char_width has no U+03A9 table entry and falls back to the ASCII a advance. Only P~a~ΩQ textLength differs (48.0835 vs 51.2446). Fresh residual_ascii_neighbor passes with Omega alone replaced by W; residual_omega_only reproduces the width error and its downstream geometry. No escape text or style disagreement remains.'
for r in residuals[2:]:r['cause']='Four size-13 rows: Java AbstractTextualComponent#getTextHeight sums text block height and 2*marginY; ComponentRoseNote#drawInternalU casts the total to int. Rust note_rendered_height floors each later row separately: floor(15.310546875+10)+3*floor(15.310546875)=70, versus floor(4*15.310546875+10)=71. Text runs/styles/positions are byte-exact, but note bottom 121.4883 vs 122.4883 fails whole output. This is unchanged sequence code; no WBS origin adjustment is justified.'
